--TEST--
a trace or profile path outside `debug.trace` or `debug.profile` throws a `RuntimeError` naming that grant, even where `fs.write` grants the same folder and the mode names the probe, and a `..` out of the granted root throws the same way — `rule:testing/debug-surface`, `rule:testing/debug-mode-directive`
--FILE--
<?nvs
// covers: Core\Debug::startTrace
// covers: Core\Debug::startProfile
class Here {
    public static function path(#[Core\Path] string $path): string {
        return $path;
    }
}
string $dir = Here::path('.');

// `fs.write` grants the whole folder, `debug.*` only `./sinks`. Writing an
// ordinary file there is allowed, and is not permission to trace into it.
Core\IO::write('./plain.txt', "plain\n");
echo Core\IO::readText('./plain.txt');
try {
    Core\Debug::startTrace('./calls.jsonl');
    echo "trace started\n";
} catch (RuntimeError $error) {
    echo $error->message, "\n";
}
try {
    Core\Debug::startProfile('./profile.json');
    echo "profile started\n";
} catch (RuntimeError $error) {
    echo $error->message, "\n";
}

// A `..` joined at run time leaves the granted root, and throws the same way.
try {
    Core\Debug::startTrace(Core\Path::join($dir, 'sinks/../calls.jsonl'));
    echo "trace started\n";
} catch (RuntimeError $error) {
    echo $error->message, "\n";
}

// Nothing was created where the grant did not reach.
echo Core\IO::exists('./calls.jsonl') ? "trace file written\n" : "no trace file\n";
echo Core\IO::exists('./profile.json') ? "profile file written\n" : "no profile file\n";
--FILE nvs.toml--
[debug]
mode = ["trace", "profile"]

[capabilities.debug]
trace = ["./sinks"]
profile = ["./sinks"]

[capabilities.fs]
read = ["."]
write = ["."]
--FILE sinks/note.txt--
note
--EXPECTF--
plain
Core\Debug::startTrace needs the capability `debug.trace` for %s%ecalls.jsonl, which is not granted
help: add `trace = ["%s"]` under `[capabilities.debug]` in nvs.toml
Core\Debug::startProfile needs the capability `debug.profile` for %s%eprofile.json, which is not granted
help: add `profile = ["%s"]` under `[capabilities.debug]` in nvs.toml
Core\Debug::startTrace needs the capability `debug.trace` for %s%esinks%e..%ecalls.jsonl, which is not granted
help: add `trace = ["%s"]` under `[capabilities.debug]` in nvs.toml
no trace file
no profile file
